<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CSN raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CSN raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- HSBC James Capel said on Wednesday it had upgraded its rating for Brazil's Companhia Siderurgica Nacional (CSN) to buy from long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;CSN remains our favorite steel company in Brazil. The company should achieve considerably higher growth than its peers over the next two years, aided by its high value-added mix of products and an aggressive investment strategy.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were unchanged at 33.40 reais in Sao Paulo.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
